  "name": "Camping Breakfast Burritos",
  "subtitle": "Chorizo, eggs, avocado, and fresh salsa wrapped in warm tortillas",
  "description": "A hearty breakfast burrito combining spiced chorizo and eggs with peppers, cheese, avocado, and a bright vegetable topping.",
